  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "review-1ce665168917-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "HE-S5-A1",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "[P1] plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/mcp_server.ts:777 将所有 .json 文件当作 batch state，包含正常生成的 .report.json。没有 active task 时，若旧 batch 的 report 先于当前 active batch 被遍历，readAnyBatchRunState 会因 report contract 不匹配而抛错，四种 observation event 均无法写入日志，违反 I9。直接依赖的未改动状态所有者 plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_state.ts:910 将 report 写在同一目录，:776 的 parser 只接受 state contract，因此读取该文件是核实新调用边界所必需。最小修复是在读取 state 前区分 report 与 state 文件，保留真实 state 错误的校验，并在 tests/claude-host-authority.test.ts 增加旧 terminal batch/report 与当前 active batch 共存的 hook-entry 回归测试；同步重新生成 bundle。",
      "anchor": "sha256:31e8ed10000711221d3e802466f78ee3e5b6a94fe81aa4389d04707b281e48d2",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "workspace 没有 active task；.imm/state/batches 同时包含合法的 a-old.json（terminal state）、由 writeBatchRunReport 正常生成的 a-old.report.json（assurance_kernel/batch_run_report/v1）以及 z-live.json（prepared 或 running state）。任一种带 session_id 的 PostToolUse、SubagentStart、SubagentStop 或 SessionEnd payload 进入 runHook，目录遍历先遇到 a-old.report.json；它被转换为 batchId a-old.report，parser 抛出 unknown contract，尚未检查 z-live.json 就中断 append。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/claude/mcp_server.ts::runHook",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_state.ts::readAnyBatchRunState",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_state.ts::parseAnyBatchRunState",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_state.ts::parseBatchRunState",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_state.ts::validateRecordShape"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "ref": "HE-S5-A1"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "review-1ce665168917-2-review-2",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "HE-S5-A1",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "[P2] tests/claude-host-authority.test.ts:1492 只验证无 task 时 UserPromptSubmit 的 phase entry，没有在约定 hook-entry seam 断言 active task 的 prompt notice。HE-S5-A1 引用的 docs/specs/host-owned-environment.spec.md 将 automated SCN-13 映射到该 acceptance，其 Then 要求 active task 的 notice 和 Reviewer events 保持原行为；新增 active-task 测试只覆盖四种 observation event，约定测试文件没有 active-task UserPromptSubmit 调用或 notice 断言。最小修复是复用 active-task fixture，经真实 --hook 入口提交 prompt，并断言返回的 active-task notice；无需修改 acceptance。",
      "anchor": "sha256:91317f557d0f1583a34b2938867df005be957e70ba0207e2a6f996f2a6064027",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "已有 active task 时提交 UserPromptSubmit。当前 tests/claude-host-authority.test.ts 的 hook-entry 测试只在没有 task 的 fixture 上提交该事件并断言 stdout 为空，因此即使 active-task notice 被删除或丢失，HE-S5-A1 的约定 seam 仍不会检测 SCN-13 的这一 Then。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "tests/claude-host-authority.test.ts::hook",
